                  "answer": "Our headquarters are based at 123 Education Lane, New York, NY 10001, with regional project site management offices operating across major metropolitan hubs."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-2",
                  "question": "Do you provide free consultation?",
                  "answer": "Yes, we provide complimentary preliminary engineering feasibility studies, initial site evaluations, and estimated cost modeling for qualified commercial and residential ventures."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-3",
                  "question": "What types of construction projects do you handle?",
                  "answer": "ArchVanta specializes in commercial office towers, industrial factories, high-density residential apartments, institutional schools, and luxury custom villas."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-4",
                  "question": "How long does a typical project take?",
                  "answer": "Timelines depend on square footage and zoning complexities. Standard luxury residences average 10–14 months, while mid-to-high rise commercial developments range between 18–26 months under strict milestone deadlines."
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-5",
                  "question": "Do you offer post-construction support?",
                  "answer": "Yes, every ArchVanta handover includes a comprehensive 10-year structural warranty, complete mechanical-electrical-plumbing (MEP) schematics, and dedicated ongoing facility maintenance support."
